stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft: create (publish=false)
    [*] --> published: create (publish=true) — full validation
    draft --> published: publish — salary range required
    published --> closed: employer closes / admin unpublishes
    published --> expired: expiresAt passes (30 days)
    closed --> published: renew
    expired --> published: renew
    draft --> [*]: delete (drafts only)
